  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Adds CC030: flags a blocking parameterless Process.WaitForExit() inside async code and rewrites it to await process.WaitForExitAsync(cancellationToken). The wait is unbounded and depends on an external program, so a hung child process pins a thread-pool thread that no cancellation or shutdown signal can reclaim; CC002 cannot catch it because the async form is a differently-named method rather than an overload. Symbol-gated to System.Diagnostics.Process, quiet unless the target framework exposes WaitForExitAsync (.NET 5+), and the WaitForExit(int) timeout overload is not flagged. 30 diagnostics.",
